的风险在积累。（口径：基于未来20日已实现收益的RankIC，读数比盘面滞后约20个交易日，仅描述环境，不构成投资建议。）", "caveat": "以上由因子IC统计自动推导，未做行业/市值中性化、未计费用与涨跌停约束，仅作市场环境识别，不构成投资建议；重要结论请先用「数据校验」页抽样核对。"}, "factors": [{"code": "mom_20", "name": "动量Momentum(20日)", "category": "price_volume", "category_name": "价量类", "desc": "近20日复权收益率，越高代表过去20日涨得越多", "has_data": true, "stats_h": {"1": {"ic_mean": -0.0367, "ic_std": 0.1703, "icir": -0.215, "win_rate": 0.416, "t_stat": -3.4, "ic_gt_002": 0.912, "recent_mean": -0.0789, "n_obs": 250, "first_date": "2025-08-28", "last_date": "2026-09-08"}, "5": {"ic_mean": -0.0454, "ic_std": 0.1701, "icir": -0.267, "win_rate": 0.404, "t_stat": -4.21, "ic_gt_002": 0.912, "recent_mean": -0.1322, "n_obs": 250, "first_date": "2025-08-22", "last_date": "2026-09-02"}, "20": {"ic_mean": -0.0626, "ic_std": 0.1637, "icir": -0.382, "win_rate": 0.388, "t_stat": -6.04, "ic_gt_002": 0.9, "recent_mean": -0.2747, "n_obs": 250, "first_date": "2025-08-01", "last_date": "2026-08-12"}}, "last_ic": 0.0352}, {"code": "rev_5", "name": "短期反转(5日)", "category": "price_volume", "category_name": "价量类", "desc": "近5日收益取负，A股经典的短期反转效应", "has_data": true, "stats_h": {"1": {"ic_mean": 0.0188, "ic_std": 0.1654, "icir": 0.114, "win_rate": 0.564, "t_stat": 1.8, "ic_gt_002": 0.912, "recent_mean": 0.0514, "n_obs": 250, "first_date": "2025-08-28", "last_date": "2026-09-08"}, "5": {"ic_mean": 0.0114, "ic_std": 0.1586, "icir": 0.072, "win_rate": 0.504, "t_stat": 1.14, "ic_gt_002": 0.904, "recent_mean": -0.0285, "n_obs": 250, "first_date": "2025-08-22", "last_date": "2026-09-02"}, "20": {"ic_mean": 0.0322, "ic_std": 0.1493, "icir": 0.215, "win_rate": 0.532, "t_stat": 3.41, "ic_gt_002": 0.916, "recent_mean": 0.197, "n_obs": 250, "first_date": "2025-08-01", "last_date": "2026-08-12"}}, "last_ic": -0.0174}, {"code": "vol_20", "name": "波动率(20日)", "category": "price_volume", "category_name": "价量类", "desc": "近20日日收益率标准差，低波动异象因子", "has_data": true, "stats_h": {"1": {"ic_mean": -0.0493, "ic_std": 0.2436, "icir": -0.202, "win_rate": 0.412, "t_